2
00:01:44.782 --> 00:01:47.201
The wall Blackhaven

3
00:01:47.284 --> 00:01:50.246
are unscalable vassalstone.

4
00:01:51.747 --> 00:01:57.211
And the castle is surrounded
by a deep. dry moat.

5
00:01:57.294 --> 00:02:02.132
It is well fortified against
any future Dornish incursions.

6
00:02:03.425 --> 00:02:07.346
And though my seat
may be lesser in size.

7
00:02:07.429 --> 00:02:11.308
it is situated most pleasingly.

8
00:02:35.499 --> 00:02:39.795
The view across
the Marches is inspiring.

9
00:02:39.879 --> 00:02:41.022
so said Queen Alysanne herself

10
00:02:41.046 --> 00:02:43.757
when she honored
my father and I...

11
00:02:43.841 --> 00:02:46.302
And tell me. Lord Dondarrion.

12
00:02:46.385 --> 00:02:48.971
did you think my great-grandmother
as beautiful as they say?

13
00:02:50.264 --> 00:02:55.436
This was half
a century ago. Princess.

14
00:02:55.519 --> 00:02:57.146
Yes. it was.

15
00:02:59.398 --> 00:03:01.734
That was unseemly. Princess.

16
00:03:01.817 --> 00:03:04.486
The man is older than my father.

17
00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:06.822
It's unseemly for him
to put himself forward

18
00:03:06.906 --> 00:03:09.033
as a contender for my hand.

19
00:03:10.576 --> 00:03:11.702
Next!

20
00:03:22.755 --> 00:03:25.132
And now a child.

21
00:03:25.215 --> 00:03:27.068
The
Blackwoods are an ancient house

22
00:03:27.092 --> 00:03:29.386
with a formidable army.

23
00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:33.682
In the Riverlands. they
once ruled as kings.

24
00:03:33.766 --> 00:03:37.144
The blood of the First
Men still flows in their veins.

25
00:03:39.438 --> 00:03:42.483
Go on.

26
00:03:42.566 --> 00:03:44.401
My Princess...

27
00:03:44.485 --> 00:03:46.320
ours is a bond that
has long endured.

28
00:03:46.403 --> 00:03:48.989
since Lucas Blackwood.
the grandsire of my grandsire.

29
00:03:49.073 --> 00:03:51.075
aided the Dragon in
his war of conquest...

30
00:03:51.158 --> 00:03:55.037
Aye. the Blackwoods truly
turned the tide on that one.

31
00:03:57.581 --> 00:03:59.333
Coursed with the
blood of the First Men.

32
00:03:59.416 --> 00:04:02.586
our history is deeply
rooted in this land.

33
00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:05.673
which your house
has made its home.

34
00:04:05.756 --> 00:04:06.983
If chosen as your
match. Princess...

35
00:04:07.007 --> 00:04:09.677
your days shall be easy

36
00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:13.013
and nights safe
under my protection.

37
00:04:13.097 --> 00:04:15.808
"Protection"? The Princess
has a dragon. you dumb cunt.

38
00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:20.020
Bracken!

39
00:04:20.104 --> 00:04:21.814
I could learn to like that one.

40
00:04:22.523 --> 00:04:25.275
Ugh. let us have the next

41
00:04:25.359 --> 00:04:27.486
so we may go to supper.

42
00:04:28.946 --> 00:04:31.031
- Craven.
- Ooh!

43
00:04:32.825 --> 00:04:35.869
We're leaving.

44
00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.206
Sheathe that steel. you twats!

45
00:04:39.289 --> 00:04:42.084
Send word to the harbor and
have Captain Oswin ready the ship.

46
00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:43.853
Princess. we're due in
Bitterbridge in three days' time.

47
00:04:43.877 --> 00:04:45.730
I would happily row myself
back to King's Landing

48
00:04:45.754 --> 00:04:47.634
if it brought an end to
this ridiculous pageant.

49
00:04:53.429 --> 00:04:55.055
Don't look. Princess.

50
00:05:16.368 --> 00:05:19.329
We should make landfall
inside the hour. Princess.

51
00:05:22.583 --> 00:05:24.168
How do you think
he will take it?

52
00:05:24.251 --> 00:05:25.645
Do you speak of how
you rejected every suitor

53
00:05:25.669 --> 00:05:28.756
His Grace put before you. or
how you abruptly ended the tour

54
00:05:28.839 --> 00:05:30.090
with two months remaining?

55
00:05:46.315 --> 00:05:48.275
Take cover!

56
00:05:52.738 --> 00:05:53.781
Princess!

57
00:05:54.907 --> 00:05:57.618
You all right? Are you?

58
00:05:57.701 --> 00:05:59.578
- Fetch the maester!
- I'm fine.

59
00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.215
It's Daemon.

60
00:07:57.696 --> 00:07:59.406
Add it to the chair.

61
00:08:15.464 --> 00:08:17.090
You wear a crown.

62
00:08:18.217 --> 00:08:19.927
Do you also call
yourself "King"?

63
00:08:20.969 --> 00:08:22.596
Once we smashed the Triarchy.

64
00:08:22.679 --> 00:08:25.599
they named me "King
of the Narrow Sea."

65
00:08:29.895 --> 00:08:33.524
But I know that there is only
one true king. Your Grace.

66
00:08:42.074 --> 00:08:46.286
My crown and the
Stepstones... are yours.

67
00:08:50.249 --> 00:08:52.251
Well. where is Lord Corlys?

68
00:08:52.334 --> 00:08:53.543
He sailed home to Driftmark.

69
00:08:53.627 --> 00:08:57.673
- Who holds the Stepstones?
- The tides...

70
00:08:57.756 --> 00:09:03.303
the crabs. and 2.000
dead Triarchy corsairs.

71
00:09:03.387 --> 00:09:06.556
staked to the sand to warn
those who might follow.

72
00:09:43.802 --> 00:09:45.137
Rise.

73
00:10:08.452 --> 00:10:11.830
The realm owes you
a great debt. brother.

74
00:10:14.958 --> 00:10:16.001
Come.

75
00:10:21.256 --> 00:10:23.550
This is our chance...

76
00:10:23.633 --> 00:10:26.136
Daemon. he would
venture off. abroad.

77
00:10:26.219 --> 00:10:29.056
winning tournaments...

78
00:10:31.058 --> 00:10:32.298
No. no. no. no. no. no. no. no.

79
00:10:32.351 --> 00:10:34.561
I will not revisit this debate.

80
00:10:34.644 --> 00:10:36.897
You were always
mother's favorite.

81
00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.066
No. it's no great mystery.

82
00:10:39.149 --> 00:10:41.360
You were.

83
00:10:41.443 --> 00:10:42.277
Our mother. she had no regard

84
00:10:42.361 --> 00:10:45.405
for custom or tradition. rules.

85
00:10:45.489 --> 00:10:49.326
And I. sadly. was
no great warrior.

86
00:10:49.409 --> 00:10:52.746
Congratulations on your victory.

87
00:10:57.250 --> 00:10:58.710
Thank you. Princess.

88
00:11:05.008 --> 00:11:07.636
Perhaps Prince Daemon would
care for a tour of the gallery?

89
00:11:07.719 --> 00:11:08.780
He hasn't yet seen
the new tapestries

90
00:11:08.804 --> 00:11:11.681
- gifted to you by Norvos and Qohor.
- Oh. oh.

91
00:11:11.765 --> 00:11:16.478
Would you like to see
the tapestries?

92
00:11:19.856 --> 00:11:22.526
He has no interest
in such things.

93
00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:26.279
I'd like to see them.

94
00:11:26.363 --> 00:11:29.324
Oh. well. then you
should not deprive yourself.

95
00:11:31.201 --> 00:11:33.078
I shall enjoy them alone.

96
00:11:36.373 --> 00:11:38.125
More wine.

97
00:11:41.711 --> 00:11:43.630
As I said. you
were the favorite.

98
00:11:43.713 --> 00:11:47.884
No. you were.
You were. I insist.

99
00:12:03.233 --> 00:12:05.527
I surmise the tour
did not go well.

100
00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:07.010
I endured it for
as long as I could.

101
00:12:09.114 --> 00:12:10.383
To have every
young knight and lord

102
00:12:10.407 --> 00:12:13.827
in the Seven Kingdoms
fawning over you...

103
00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:16.955
What misery.

104
00:12:18.748 --> 00:12:22.419
It is rare for girls in this realm to
get a choice between two suitors.

105
00:12:22.502 --> 00:12:25.338
no less two score of them.

106
00:12:25.422 --> 00:12:28.633
Those men and boys
don't fawn over me.

107
00:12:28.717 --> 00:12:31.553
They only want my name and
my Valyrian blood for their offspring.

108
00:12:33.513 --> 00:12:36.391
I think it's rather romantic.

109
00:12:38.059 --> 00:12:41.354
How romantic it must be
to get imprisoned in a castle

110
00:12:41.438 --> 00:12:43.899
and made to squeeze out heirs.

111
00:12:48.862 --> 00:12:49.905
Sorry.

112
00:12:58.330 --> 00:13:00.790
How angry is he?

113
00:13:04.836 --> 00:13:07.255
The King went through great
effort to arrange your tour.

114
00:13:07.339 --> 00:13:10.967
He is... frustrated.

115
00:13:11.051 --> 00:13:13.595
But I am glad you are home.

116
00:13:16.848 --> 00:13:21.811
I find I have...
few friends lately.

117
00:13:21.895 --> 00:13:24.898
I like to believe I'm still
the Lady Alicent. but...

118
00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:31.154
all anyone sees when they
look at me now is "The Queen."

119
00:13:32.405 --> 00:13:35.242
I've missed you. too.

120
00:14:10.193 --> 00:14:11.278
So...

121
00:14:12.779 --> 00:14:14.072
what do you want?

122
00:14:14.781 --> 00:14:16.783
Only the comforts of home.

123
00:14:24.583 --> 00:14:28.587
I had not thought you particularly
comfortable in this home.

124
00:14:31.506 --> 00:14:35.051
Though I do suppose you seem
changed by your adventures.

125
00:14:36.386 --> 00:14:38.805
More mature. perhaps.

126
00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:43.435
You've matured yourself
these last four years. Princess.

127
00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:47.897
You'll get used
to the attention.

128
00:14:47.981 --> 00:14:48.732
The attention I can endure.

129
00:14:48.815 --> 00:14:51.401
It's the rest I
could do without.

130
00:14:51.484 --> 00:14:53.403
My father seems
content to sell me off

131
00:14:53.486 --> 00:14:56.823
to whichever lord
has the biggest castle.

132
00:14:56.906 --> 00:14:59.492
There are worse
things to be sold for.

133
00:15:29.314 --> 00:15:31.775
Oh...

134
00:16:16.569 --> 00:16:20.031
Such a lonely prospect.

135
00:16:21.866 --> 00:16:24.053
The Stepstones
were meant to be won for the realm.

136
00:16:24.077 --> 00:16:26.454
but over the past few days.
it seems we have traded

137
00:16:26.538 --> 00:16:28.832
a crabfeeder for a seasnake.

138
00:16:28.915 --> 00:16:33.503
This is clearly a rebuke for passing
over Lady Laena for Queen Alicent.

139
00:16:33.586 --> 00:16:36.548
Years have passed since
the business with his daughter.

140
00:16:36.631 --> 00:16:38.633
Certainly. he
cannot still be wroth?

141
00:16:38.717 --> 00:16:42.637
The Sea Snake is an over-proud
man. to be sure. Your Grace.

142
00:16:42.721 --> 00:16:44.764
That pride has been injured.

143
00:16:44.848 --> 00:16:47.767
Perhaps we can salve the wound?

144
00:16:47.851 --> 00:16:50.103
I fear Lord Corlys's pride
is the least of our worries.

145
00:16:50.186 --> 00:16:52.897
I don't wish to cause
you further distress.

146
00:16:52.981 --> 00:16:57.110
Your Grace. but my brother has
sent disturbing word from Oldtown.

147
00:16:57.193 --> 00:17:00.488
Lord Corlys is said to have
engaged in negotiations

148
00:17:00.572 --> 00:17:01.781
with the Sealord of Braavos.

149
00:17:01.865 --> 00:17:05.994
He plans to wed his daughter
Laena to the Sealord's son.

150
00:17:08.038 --> 00:17:11.416
If House Velaryon
entered into an alliance

151
00:17:11.499 --> 00:17:14.335
with the Free Cities...

152
00:17:14.419 --> 00:17:16.337
then...

153
00:17:16.421 --> 00:17:20.383
we would have to seek
our own marriage pact.

154
00:18:09.432 --> 00:18:12.435
- Good night. Ser Criston.
- Sleep well. Princess.

155
00:19:26.676 --> 00:19:29.721
Whoa!

156
00:20:32.575 --> 00:20:34.452
Where are we going?

157
00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:01.270
Fuck off. boy.

158
00:21:03.356 --> 00:21:04.691
He called me boy.

159
00:21:24.293 --> 00:21:27.088
Do you wish to know
your death. child?

160
00:21:44.981 --> 00:21:46.607
Let me take that.

161
00:22:00.997 --> 00:22:03.332
Leave us. all of you.

162
00:22:21.434 --> 00:22:25.229
You have a far kinder
touch than they do.

163
00:22:25.313 --> 00:22:26.689
Thank you. husband.

164
00:22:28.858 --> 00:22:35.198
<i>And now we come to
the matter of the great Iron Chair...</i>

165
00:22:35.948 --> 00:22:39.243
and whose bum it might bear.

166
00:22:39.327 --> 00:22:41.204
Our good King...

167
00:22:41.287 --> 00:22:42.789
names his daughter.

168
00:22:42.872 --> 00:22:45.917
a girl. his heir.

169
00:22:50.046 --> 00:22:53.674
But then to him. a babe is born.

170
00:23:02.558 --> 00:23:04.936
A son!

171
00:23:05.019 --> 00:23:09.482
To which
heir might the chair bear?

172
00:23:09.565 --> 00:23:10.817
Who will it be?

173
00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:12.235
The brother? The daughter?

174
00:23:12.318 --> 00:23:14.695
Or the little
princeling of three?

175
00:23:27.166 --> 00:23:31.420
Rhaenyra... the Realm's Delight.

176
00:23:31.504 --> 00:23:34.340
a girl so young and so slight...

177
00:23:35.341 --> 00:23:38.553
loved by all of her people.

178
00:23:38.636 --> 00:23:42.390
but would she make
a powerful queen.

179
00:23:42.473 --> 00:23:44.350
- or would she be feeble?
- Feeble!

180
00:23:44.433 --> 00:23:47.019
Though Aegon. the babe Prince.

181
00:23:47.103 --> 00:23:49.021
might long for a claim.

182
00:23:49.105 --> 00:23:52.108
he has two things
Rhaenyra cannot:

183
00:23:52.191 --> 00:23:53.359
a conqueror's name...

184
00:23:54.944 --> 00:23:56.237
and a cock.

185
00:23:59.365 --> 00:24:01.367
Lies. slander!

186
00:24:01.450 --> 00:24:02.452
Boo!

187
00:24:02.535 --> 00:24:04.245
Jest if you will.

188
00:24:04.328 --> 00:24:06.247
but many of the
smallfolk are like to believe

189
00:24:06.330 --> 00:24:09.375
that. as a male. Aegon
should be the heir.

190
00:24:09.458 --> 00:24:12.712
Mm. Their wants are
of no consequence.

191
00:24:15.756 --> 00:24:16.966
They're of great consequence

192
00:24:17.049 --> 00:24:19.218
if you expect to
rule them one day.

193
00:24:20.845 --> 00:24:22.221
For one night. I wish to be free

194
00:24:22.305 --> 00:24:23.585
of the burdens
of my inheritance.

195
00:24:30.980 --> 00:24:32.148
Four coppers. street rat.

196
00:24:32.231 --> 00:24:33.951
In King's Landing. we
pay for our pleasures.

197
00:24:35.818 --> 00:24:36.444
- Hey!
- Stop! Boy!

198
00:24:36.527 --> 00:24:38.404
Wait. I'll find him.

199
00:25:17.026 --> 00:25:20.238
And who
might you be running from. now?

200
00:25:20.321 --> 00:25:21.989
Ser Harwin.

201
00:25:22.073 --> 00:25:25.076
Princess.

202
00:25:26.077 --> 00:25:28.537
Don't.

203
00:25:30.373 --> 00:25:32.083
You take care. boy.

204
00:25:32.166 --> 00:25:33.668
Next time. you
might not be so lucky.

205
00:25:38.839 --> 00:25:41.884
Enjoyed that. did you?

206
00:25:42.260 --> 00:25:45.763
Who knows when I'll next taste freedom?

207
00:25:58.067 --> 00:25:59.944
Come.

208
00:26:04.699 --> 00:26:06.659
Pardon me. Your Grace.

209
00:26:06.742 --> 00:26:08.661
The King has
requested your presence.

210
00:26:14.542 --> 00:26:16.043
The hour is quite late.

211
00:26:16.127 --> 00:26:17.753
Yes. Your Grace.

212
00:28:23.504 --> 00:28:26.549
What is this place?

213
00:28:26.632 --> 00:28:29.135
It's where people
come to take what they want.

214
00:28:51.365 --> 00:28:53.742
Fucking is a pleasure. you see.

215
00:28:55.369 --> 00:28:57.746
For the woman as it is the man.

216
00:29:11.594 --> 00:29:13.721
<i>A marriage is a duty... Yes.</i>

217
00:29:18.934 --> 00:29:21.896
<i>But that doesn't stop us
from doing what we want.</i>

218
00:29:25.858 --> 00:29:27.735
<i>From fucking who we want.</i>

219
00:30:48.941 --> 00:30:49.984
Daemon?

220
00:31:28.439 --> 00:31:30.524
Princess?

221
00:31:38.991 --> 00:31:40.868
Princess. are you. are you hurt?

222
00:31:43.078 --> 00:31:47.041
- I-I should alert the Lord Commander.
- No.

223
00:31:51.754 --> 00:31:55.215
My helmet.

224
00:32:02.806 --> 00:32:04.016
You finished?

225
00:32:06.435 --> 00:32:08.687
Thank you.

226
00:32:39.843 --> 00:32:40.886
Stop.

227
00:36:41.835 --> 00:36:43.275
Apologies for the
late hour. my Lord.

228
00:36:43.337 --> 00:36:46.131
- What is it?
- A messenger brings word from the White Worm.

229
00:37:12.491 --> 00:37:14.952
Am I your prisoner?

230
00:37:15.035 --> 00:37:17.162
As I was once yours?

231
00:37:21.083 --> 00:37:25.003
I'm your protector.
lucky for you.

232
00:37:31.969 --> 00:37:33.303
This will cut the fog.

233
00:37:37.057 --> 00:37:38.743
I don't need protection
from a common whore.

234
00:37:38.767 --> 00:37:40.394
I am not so common.

235
00:37:42.980 --> 00:37:45.524
A not-so-common whore then.

236
00:37:45.607 --> 00:37:48.026
I've left that life behind.

237
00:37:48.110 --> 00:37:49.987
I learned that skin-trade

238
00:37:50.070 --> 00:37:52.239
could only take
me so far in this life.

239
00:37:53.281 --> 00:37:56.243
You never were one to stay idle.

240
00:37:56.326 --> 00:37:59.705
Hard lessons are not
welcomed but suffered.

241
00:38:11.341 --> 00:38:12.926
Mysar...

242
00:38:13.885 --> 00:38:15.762
Mysar...

243
00:38:15.846 --> 00:38:18.307
You can pay for
the room on your way out.

244
00:38:44.332 --> 00:38:45.459
Come.

245
00:38:55.052 --> 00:38:57.888
What is it?

246
00:38:57.971 --> 00:39:00.640
I apologize for the
early hour. Your Grace.

247
00:39:01.516 --> 00:39:02.851
I have. um...

248
00:39:04.061 --> 00:39:05.270
discomforting news.

249
00:39:05.354 --> 00:39:06.980
I thought it best
shared discreetly

250
00:39:07.064 --> 00:39:07.773
before the council convenes.

251
00:39:07.856 --> 00:39:10.734
The Sea Snake.

252
00:39:13.904 --> 00:39:16.865
I'm afraid it concerns
the Princess. my King.

253
00:39:18.533 --> 00:39:20.160
Has she been harmed?

254
00:39:25.248 --> 00:39:26.625
It is no easy thing

255
00:39:26.708 --> 00:39:29.669
to tell a father of his
daughter's exploits.

256
00:39:30.962 --> 00:39:32.839
I had considered
saying nothing. but...

257
00:39:32.923 --> 00:39:34.716
What has she done?

258
00:39:38.220 --> 00:39:40.680
The Princess was
spied last evening...

259
00:39:41.473 --> 00:39:44.601
beyond the walls of the Keep...

260
00:39:46.311 --> 00:39:47.771
in a pleasure house.

261
00:39:48.563 --> 00:39:50.190
What of it?

262
00:39:50.273 --> 00:39:52.442
She was carrying
on with her uncle.

263
00:39:55.028 --> 00:39:56.047
They were engaged in behaviors

264
00:39:56.071 --> 00:39:59.491
unbecoming of a maiden...

265
00:40:01.159 --> 00:40:02.911
of a Princess.

266
00:40:05.914 --> 00:40:07.541
What behaviors?

267
00:40:13.797 --> 00:40:15.799
Well. must I say it. Your Grace?

268
00:40:15.882 --> 00:40:16.550
You enter my bedchamber.

269
00:40:16.633 --> 00:40:19.094
accusing my
daughter of something.

270
00:40:19.177 --> 00:40:21.596
Now speak it... plainly.

271
00:40:25.475 --> 00:40:28.228
Daemon and Rhaenyra
were seen together...

272
00:40:29.938 --> 00:40:31.982
in the bowels of a pleasure den.

273
00:40:43.326 --> 00:40:44.411
Coupling.

274
00:40:52.752 --> 00:40:54.296
This is a lie.

275
00:40:55.213 --> 00:40:57.841
You have been lied to.

276
00:40:57.924 --> 00:41:00.093
I only wish that were
true. Your Grace.

277
00:41:02.179 --> 00:41:05.223
Who is responsible
for this gossip?

278
00:41:05.307 --> 00:41:07.809
Have this rumormonger
brought before me at once.

279
00:41:07.893 --> 00:41:09.728
And I will take their eyes.

280
00:41:09.811 --> 00:41:13.398
As your Hand. I must maintain
trusted sources of information.

281
00:41:13.481 --> 00:41:16.943
And this one. as yet.
has never led me astray.

282
00:41:17.027 --> 00:41:20.405
And several of the servants
have now admitted to seeing her.

283
00:41:20.488 --> 00:41:22.407
the Princess...

284
00:41:22.490 --> 00:41:24.868
creeping through the
gates from King's Landing.

285
00:41:24.951 --> 00:41:26.745
disguised as a page

286
00:41:26.828 --> 00:41:28.997
during the hour of the owl.

287
00:41:30.332 --> 00:41:32.500
Are you so sick with ambition

288
00:41:32.584 --> 00:41:35.003
that you would have
my daughter stalked?

289
00:41:35.086 --> 00:41:37.339
Spied upon?

290
00:41:37.422 --> 00:41:41.218
Awaiting your best chance
to destroy her reputation?

291
00:41:41.301 --> 00:41:43.303
I have no such
intent. Your Grace.

292
00:41:43.386 --> 00:41:46.306
You think yourself
a cunning man.

293
00:41:47.349 --> 00:41:48.850
Your designs are obvious.

294
00:41:50.685 --> 00:41:52.966
Do you wish to have your
blood on the Iron Throne so badly

295
00:41:53.021 --> 00:41:54.621
that you are willing
to destroy mine own?

296
00:41:56.942 --> 00:41:59.027
Just get out.

297
00:42:02.239 --> 00:42:05.617
Leave me... at once.

298
00:42:10.872 --> 00:42:13.917
Your Grace.

299
00:42:52.831 --> 00:42:55.208
I'm dressed. Annora. Come.

300
00:43:04.926 --> 00:43:06.219
Princess.

301
00:43:11.933 --> 00:43:13.101
Come.

302
00:43:22.777 --> 00:43:24.612
Princess. I-I have a
message from the Queen.

303
00:43:50.138 --> 00:43:51.765
What happened last night?

304
00:43:53.558 --> 00:43:55.560
What do you mean?

305
00:43:55.644 --> 00:43:58.438
My father has made some
worrying allegations about you.

306
00:44:00.357 --> 00:44:02.776
Were you with your uncle?

307
00:44:05.111 --> 00:44:07.072
Oh. I...

308
00:44:07.155 --> 00:44:08.740
I haven't seen him in years.

309
00:44:08.823 --> 00:44:09.532
He took me into
the city for some fun.

310
00:44:09.616 --> 00:44:12.619
Tell me the whole
of it. Rhaenyra.

311
00:44:12.702 --> 00:44:14.621
Your father accused
me of something.

312
00:44:15.830 --> 00:44:17.832
That I drank wine?

313
00:44:17.916 --> 00:44:20.418
Left the castle after dark?

314
00:44:20.502 --> 00:44:22.462
That you fucked Daemon
in a pleasure house.

315
00:44:31.179 --> 00:44:35.350
This is a vile accusation.

316
00:44:35.433 --> 00:44:36.267
Is it?

317
00:44:36.351 --> 00:44:39.521
You Targaryens do
have queer customs.

318
00:44:39.604 --> 00:44:42.607
- And Daemon certainly knows no limit.
- Alicent...

319
00:44:42.690 --> 00:44:45.318
Your Grace. sister.
you must know I would.

320
00:44:45.402 --> 00:44:46.820
I would never.

321
00:44:46.903 --> 00:44:48.279
You cannot believe such gossip.

322
00:44:48.363 --> 00:44:49.614
My father is no gossip.

323
00:44:49.697 --> 00:44:50.925
Well. certainly
he's been misled.

324
00:44:50.949 --> 00:44:52.343
He could not have
witnessed such a thing.

325
00:44:52.367 --> 00:44:54.077
- Why not?
- Because it did not happen.

326
00:44:54.160 --> 00:44:56.037
- He was told that you...
- Told?

327
00:44:57.705 --> 00:44:59.707
Who made these
claims to your father?

328
00:45:04.337 --> 00:45:07.090
I am the Princess. To...

329
00:45:07.173 --> 00:45:10.093
To question my virtue
is an act of treason.

330
00:45:12.429 --> 00:45:15.849
- I do not know specifically...
- What. your father did not tell you?

331
00:45:15.932 --> 00:45:17.809
He reported it to the King.

332
00:45:20.728 --> 00:45:21.813
I overheard.

333
00:45:25.900 --> 00:45:28.570
So you are accusing
me of slanders...

334
00:45:29.237 --> 00:45:31.656
you overheard?

335
00:45:31.740 --> 00:45:33.867
I only want to help
you. Rhaenyra.

336
00:45:40.915 --> 00:45:44.377
Okay. we...
we drank in a tavern.

337
00:45:46.045 --> 00:45:47.672
Several... taverns.

338
00:45:49.674 --> 00:45:51.259
It was getting late...

339
00:45:51.342 --> 00:45:53.720
and I asked to go home.

340
00:45:54.804 --> 00:45:56.723
But Daemon wished to continue.

341
00:45:59.642 --> 00:46:01.245
As he was my escort.
I had no real choice.

342
00:46:01.269 --> 00:46:03.396
"Continue"...

343
00:46:05.273 --> 00:46:08.026
in a brothel?

344
00:46:08.109 --> 00:46:10.403
He took me to a show. I...

345
00:46:12.197 --> 00:46:15.158
I was only a spectator.
I didn't do anything.

346
00:46:19.871 --> 00:46:22.790
And then Daemon sank
into his cups and. uh...

347
00:46:25.335 --> 00:46:28.755
abandoned me for some whore.

348
00:46:32.509 --> 00:46:35.386
I should've known better.

349
00:46:41.476 --> 00:46:42.894
So you did not?

350
00:46:45.980 --> 00:46:48.608
Must I truly refute that?

351
00:46:52.320 --> 00:46:54.989
Daemon never touched me.

352
00:46:56.658 --> 00:46:58.576
Okay. I swear this to you

353
00:46:58.660 --> 00:47:00.787
upon the memory of my mother.

354
00:47:04.249 --> 00:47:06.334
It was foolish of you to
place yourself in a position

355
00:47:06.417 --> 00:47:08.297
where your virtue could
even come into question.

356
00:47:12.674 --> 00:47:14.551
The King has strived to
find you a good match.

357
00:47:14.634 --> 00:47:16.761
And so have I.

358
00:47:16.844 --> 00:47:19.055
If that lord were to
think that you had been...

359
00:47:21.015 --> 00:47:22.058
sullied...

360
00:47:23.726 --> 00:47:26.271
- it would ruin everything.
- I know...

361
00:47:27.146 --> 00:47:30.066
Your Grace.

362
00:47:30.149 --> 00:47:31.234
I regret it.

363
00:47:45.873 --> 00:47:49.002
The King demands
an audience. my Prince.

364
00:47:49.085 --> 00:47:50.795
Take your fucking hands off me.

365
00:48:39.510 --> 00:48:40.720
My daughter.

366
00:48:48.227 --> 00:48:50.730
Won't you even deny it?

367
00:48:50.813 --> 00:48:51.689
I need to understand the charge

368
00:48:51.773 --> 00:48:53.941
before I can
attempt to discredit it.

369
00:48:56.110 --> 00:48:57.487
You defiled her.

370
00:49:06.162 --> 00:49:06.996
Still. you say nothing.

371
00:49:07.080 --> 00:49:10.083
Oh. what
does it matter. brother?

372
00:49:10.166 --> 00:49:11.417
When we were Rhaenyra's age.

373
00:49:11.501 --> 00:49:12.519
we fucked our way
through most of the brothels

374
00:49:12.543 --> 00:49:14.921
on the Street of Silk.

375
00:49:15.004 --> 00:49:16.964
We were young men.

376
00:49:17.048 --> 00:49:18.883
She is just a girl.

377
00:49:18.966 --> 00:49:21.177
- Your niece!
- Rhaenyra's a woman-grown.

378
00:49:21.260 --> 00:49:23.721
Better her first experience
be with me than some whore.

379
00:49:23.805 --> 00:49:25.598
You fucking...

380
00:49:25.682 --> 00:49:27.892
You have ruined her!

381
00:49:27.975 --> 00:49:30.978
What lord will wed her
now? In this condition?

382
00:49:31.062 --> 00:49:33.731
Who gives a fuck
what some lord thinks?

383
00:49:33.815 --> 00:49:37.735
You are the dragon.
Your word is truth and law.

384
00:49:37.819 --> 00:49:40.822
I have spent a
lifetime defending you.

385
00:49:40.905 --> 00:49:42.633
But your heart is even
blacker than I thought.

386
00:49:42.657 --> 00:49:45.451
I should disinherit her

387
00:49:45.535 --> 00:49:47.995
as I already did you
and be done with it.

388
00:49:49.122 --> 00:49:50.707
Wed her to me.

389
00:49:51.999 --> 00:49:55.420
When I offered up my crown.
you said I could have anything.

390
00:49:55.503 --> 00:49:56.980
I want Rhaenyra.
I'll take her as she is.

391
00:49:57.004 --> 00:49:59.757
and wed her in the
tradition of our house.

392
00:49:59.841 --> 00:50:01.300
You are already wed.

393
00:50:01.384 --> 00:50:04.053
That didn't stop Aegon the
Conqueror from taking a second wife.

394
00:50:05.638 --> 00:50:07.306
You are no conqueror.

395
00:50:07.390 --> 00:50:10.768
You are a plague...
sent to destroy me.

396
00:50:10.852 --> 00:50:13.938
Give me Rhaenyra to take to wife

397
00:50:14.021 --> 00:50:17.608
and we will return the House
of the Dragon to its proper glory.

398
00:50:17.692 --> 00:50:18.943
Of course.

399
00:50:19.026 --> 00:50:21.779
It's not my daughter
you lust for. is it?

400
00:50:22.613 --> 00:50:25.616
It's my throne.

401
00:50:26.534 --> 00:50:29.036
Go back to the Vale. Daemon.

402
00:50:29.120 --> 00:50:31.998
to your lawful wife.

403
00:50:32.081 --> 00:50:36.961
Strive to restore whatever
scrap of honor remains in you.

404
00:50:37.044 --> 00:50:40.548
Or don't. Matters not to me.

405
00:50:40.631 --> 00:50:43.050
As long as you are gone
from my sight for good.

406
00:50:50.516 --> 00:50:52.351
As you wish. brother.

407
00:51:21.672 --> 00:51:24.300
Have you spoken to her?

408
00:51:26.928 --> 00:51:29.972
No.

409
00:51:33.142 --> 00:51:35.895
It is not in Rhaenyra's
nature to be deceitful.

410
00:51:37.063 --> 00:51:38.583
I cannot say the
same for your brother.

411
00:51:40.024 --> 00:51:41.400
You believe he lied?

412
00:51:42.652 --> 00:51:44.862
How often does he
speak the pure truth?

413
00:51:45.947 --> 00:51:49.033
How does confessing
to such things serve him?

414
00:51:52.078 --> 00:51:55.122
By reducing you.

415
00:51:59.961 --> 00:52:04.382
Whatever transpired.
Rhaenyra is not innocent.

416
00:52:04.465 --> 00:52:07.009
Only because Daemon
tried to corrupt her.

417
00:52:07.093 --> 00:52:10.263
Daemon and Rhaenyra
share the blood of the dragon.

418
00:52:10.346 --> 00:52:12.056
They are restless and chaotic.

419
00:52:12.139 --> 00:52:14.100
She swore to me that
she remains a maiden.

420
00:52:15.810 --> 00:52:18.145
And I believe her.

421
00:53:22.501 --> 00:53:23.961
That dagger

422
00:53:24.045 --> 00:53:25.485
once belonged to
Aegon the Conqueror.

423
00:53:27.757 --> 00:53:29.634
It was Aenar's before that.

424
00:53:30.593 --> 00:53:32.803
And before that...

425
00:53:32.887 --> 00:53:35.014
well. it is difficult to know.

426
00:53:40.603 --> 00:53:44.690
Before Aegon's death. the
last of the Valyrian pyromancers

427
00:53:44.774 --> 00:53:46.192
hid his song in the steel.

428
00:53:53.074 --> 00:53:56.619
"From my blood...

429
00:53:56.702 --> 00:53:59.997
"come the Prince
That Was Promised...

430
00:54:02.083 --> 00:54:05.586
and his will be the
Song of Ice and Fire."

431
00:54:10.091 --> 00:54:13.511
The responsibility I
have handed to you.

432
00:54:13.594 --> 00:54:15.763
the burden of this knowledge...

433
00:54:17.056 --> 00:54:20.518
it is larger than
the throne. the king.

434
00:54:20.601 --> 00:54:22.061
It is larger than you

435
00:54:22.144 --> 00:54:24.188
and your desires.

436
00:54:28.943 --> 00:54:31.404
Jaehaerys would've
disinherited you.

437
00:54:31.487 --> 00:54:32.571
For a lie?

438
00:54:34.073 --> 00:54:36.701
You've yet to ask me for
the truth of what happened.

439
00:54:36.784 --> 00:54:39.328
The truth does not
matter. Rhaenyra.

440
00:54:39.412 --> 00:54:41.205
Only perception.

441
00:54:41.288 --> 00:54:42.206
You have exposed yourself.

442
00:54:42.289 --> 00:54:45.626
Now we must both
suffer the consequences.

443
00:54:45.710 --> 00:54:49.630
Were I born a man. I could
bed whomever I wanted.

444
00:54:49.714 --> 00:54:51.257
I could father a dozen bastards.

445
00:54:51.340 --> 00:54:53.259
and no one in your
court would blink an eye.

446
00:54:53.342 --> 00:54:57.555
You are right... but
you were born a woman.

447
00:54:57.638 --> 00:55:01.225
So you'll strip me of my titles
and name Aegon in my stead.

448
00:55:01.308 --> 00:55:03.394
I would.

449
00:55:03.477 --> 00:55:05.855
But it is mine to hold
the realm together.

450
00:55:05.938 --> 00:55:07.648
not sow it with
further division.

451
00:55:09.525 --> 00:55:12.069
Your courtship is at an end.

452
00:55:12.153 --> 00:55:14.405
You will wed Ser
Laenor Velaryon.

453
00:55:14.488 --> 00:55:16.866
and you will do
so without protest.

454
00:55:17.575 --> 00:55:19.952
The son of the Sea Snake.

455
00:55:20.036 --> 00:55:22.538
So I can be a remedy for
your political headaches.

456
00:55:22.621 --> 00:55:25.332
You are my political headache!

457
00:55:29.712 --> 00:55:31.964
Your wedding to
Ser Laenor Velaryon

458
00:55:32.048 --> 00:55:34.759
will unite the two most
powerful houses in the realm.

459
00:55:34.842 --> 00:55:39.055
With the combined strength of
our shared dragons and naval fleets.

460
00:55:39.138 --> 00:55:40.765
no one would dare
to stand against us.

461
00:55:40.848 --> 00:55:42.224
The House of the Dragon

462
00:55:42.308 --> 00:55:45.686
will stand as one for
a further generation.

463
00:55:45.770 --> 00:55:47.205
And what will you
do about the vulture

464
00:55:47.229 --> 00:55:49.940
who perches upon your throne?

465
00:55:50.024 --> 00:55:51.358
What vulture?

466
00:55:52.026 --> 00:55:54.862
Your Hand.

467
00:55:54.945 --> 00:55:59.158
Otto Hightower has served
two kings loyally and faithfully.

468
00:56:00.242 --> 00:56:02.912
He wants Aegon to be named heir.

469
00:56:02.995 --> 00:56:05.498
And he will stop at
nothing to see it done.

470
00:56:05.581 --> 00:56:08.584
Including spying on me
to bring about my ruin.

471
00:56:09.502 --> 00:56:12.588
You speak of The
Conqueror's vision

472
00:56:12.671 --> 00:56:15.132
and the need for strength
and unity across the realm.

473
00:56:15.216 --> 00:56:17.635
But how can that be accomplished

474
00:56:17.718 --> 00:56:19.488
with your most trusted
adviser so self-interested?

475
00:56:19.512 --> 00:56:21.972
Every lord and lady that
calls for an audience with me.

476
00:56:22.056 --> 00:56:24.767
every man on my small council.

477
00:56:24.850 --> 00:56:27.895
and all councils past.
has been self-interested.

478
00:56:27.978 --> 00:56:30.356
- It is unavoidable.
- I disagree.

479
00:56:30.439 --> 00:56:32.942
I will do my duty as heir

480
00:56:33.025 --> 00:56:34.610
and wed Ser Laenor.

481
00:56:37.029 --> 00:56:39.698
But you must first
do yours as king.

482
00:56:50.126 --> 00:56:52.253
Your Grace.

483
00:56:54.880 --> 00:56:56.173
Five days.

484
00:56:59.510 --> 00:57:01.345
I'm sorry. Your Grace?

485
00:57:01.428 --> 00:57:03.931
Though it was some time ago.

486
00:57:04.014 --> 00:57:07.852
The details... they
fade in memory.

487
00:57:07.935 --> 00:57:11.355
My father was a hale and
healthy warrior and dragonrider

488
00:57:11.438 --> 00:57:13.190
at the peak of his abilities.

489
00:57:13.274 --> 00:57:15.860
Jaehaerys named
a great royal hunt

490
00:57:15.943 --> 00:57:18.237
to celebrate him being
named the Hand of the King.

491
00:57:19.446 --> 00:57:23.951
Five days later my...
my father lay dead.

492
00:57:25.786 --> 00:57:27.288
Tourneys last longer.

493
00:57:28.122 --> 00:57:31.250
Baelon the Brave.

494
00:57:31.333 --> 00:57:33.419
rider of Vhagar.

495
00:57:33.502 --> 00:57:35.379
heir to the Iron Throne...

496
00:57:36.046 --> 00:57:38.883
dead of a burst belly.

497
00:57:40.926 --> 00:57:43.387
The gods have a dark wit.

498
00:57:43.470 --> 00:57:44.513
It was a grim day.

499
00:57:46.640 --> 00:57:49.310
- I recall it all too well.
- Yeah...

500
00:57:50.186 --> 00:57:52.313
It was a good day for you.

501
00:57:53.564 --> 00:57:56.275
Jaehaerys named you
Hand in Baelon's stead.

502
00:57:59.486 --> 00:58:02.448
That's hardly how I
viewed it. Your Grace.

503
00:58:03.449 --> 00:58:05.034
It was a duty.

504
00:58:07.745 --> 00:58:11.498
You served my grandsire
nobly in his final days.

505
00:58:12.958 --> 00:58:15.294
You are the man that
taught me how to be King.

506
00:58:17.213 --> 00:58:21.258
Oh. you honor me. Your Grace.

507
00:58:21.342 --> 00:58:22.927
Just five days...

508
00:58:24.637 --> 00:58:28.015
you went from being another
man in Jaehaerys's court.

509
00:58:28.098 --> 00:58:30.142
to the second most
powerful man in the realm.

510
00:58:31.435 --> 00:58:32.478
I wonder...

511
00:58:34.021 --> 00:58:36.815
how long did it take you to
choose yourself over your King?

512
00:58:39.026 --> 00:58:41.070
Your Grace?

513
00:58:42.363 --> 00:58:44.865
I will never recover
from Aemma's death.

514
00:58:45.366 --> 00:58:47.993
But Alicent...

515
00:58:48.077 --> 00:58:50.079
she took me through
the worst of my grief.

516
00:58:52.539 --> 00:58:55.167
She was a calculated
distraction.

517
00:58:56.293 --> 00:58:59.588
I only now realize
how well-calculated it was.

518
00:58:59.672 --> 00:59:02.633
That is an absurdity.

519
00:59:02.716 --> 00:59:04.551
The Queen loves you...

520
00:59:06.011 --> 00:59:07.846
as I know you love her.

521
00:59:07.930 --> 00:59:10.516
Your interests no longer align
with those of the realm.

522
00:59:10.599 --> 00:59:13.852
Your judgment has
been compromised.

523
00:59:13.936 --> 00:59:16.480
A loyal Hand must tell his king

524
00:59:16.563 --> 00:59:19.650
a discomforting truth
from time to time. Your Grace.

525
00:59:19.733 --> 00:59:21.360
If he doesn't...

526
00:59:22.736 --> 00:59:24.655
he's failed as a servant.

527
00:59:25.739 --> 00:59:28.158
You were a faithful
servant. Otto.

528
00:59:37.835 --> 00:59:39.545
The crown and the realm

529
00:59:39.628 --> 00:59:42.589
both owe you a debt
that can never be repaid.

530
00:59:43.882 --> 00:59:46.427
But I can no longer
trust your judgment.

531
01:00:10.034 --> 01:00:11.994
Come.

532
01:00:16.790 --> 01:00:19.752
I hope you can forgive
the late hour. Princess.

533
01:00:24.631 --> 01:00:27.593
I took great care
in its preparation.

534
01:00:30.471 --> 01:00:33.265
If not brewed properly.
it can either prove ineffective

535
01:00:33.349 --> 01:00:35.225
or else bear

536
01:00:35.309 --> 01:00:37.478
- unpleasant...
- Brewed properly?

537
01:00:39.146 --> 01:00:40.814
I'm sorry. what is that?

538
01:00:41.648 --> 01:00:42.691
A tea. Princess.

539
01:00:44.318 --> 01:00:46.862
From the King.

540
01:00:46.945 --> 01:00:52.117
It will rid you of any
unwanted consequences.

